Here is the code in Python:
```python
def lengthOfLongestSubsequence(nums):
    n = len(nums)
    dp = [0] * n
    for i in range(n):
        dp[i] = nums[i]
    for j in range(1, n):
        for i in range(j):
            if nums[i] > nums[i+1]:
                dp[i] = max(dp[i], dp[i+1] + 1)
    return dp[-1]
```
